  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Upgrade DV:</strong> DV 17<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> Cost #1: Cost of a blunt Melee Weapon and a Stun Baton.\nCost #2: 100eb<br>\n<strong>Thermometer:</strong> Applues Non-lethal at a cost.<br>\n<strong>Applies To:</strong> A Blunt Melee Weapon<br>\n<strong>Vendor:</strong> Toaster</p>\n<p>Renders the weapon non-lethal. If this weapon reduces a target below 1 HP, it instead lower's the target to 1 HP and knocks them Unconsious for a minute. This weapon can not inflict Critical Injuries or or ablate armor.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Price is Cost #2 only; Cost #1 is the cost of a blunt Melee Weapon and a Stun Baton.</li>\n<li>Not automated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Invented Tech Upgrades).</em></p>"
